    "title": "MICROSERVICE_PROD_Funds Confirmation Consent Management API",
    "description": "The Funds Confirmation Consent Management API enables financial institutions to securely manage user consents for funds confirmation requests. This service facilitates the initiation of consents from users, allowing them to authorize access to confirm the availability of funds in their accounts. Typical consumers of this API include banks and fintech applications looking to enhance their open banking capabilities while ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements. Use cases involve retrieving and managing users' consent information in a seamless and secure manner.",
